  "draft_py": "# {2}{W}: Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card with power 2 or\n# less from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a\n# random order.  (M21 Garruk's Harbinger's look / reveal-one / rest form)\nTOP = (Zone(kind=ZoneKind.LIBRARY, controller=ControllerRef.YOU, position=ZonePosition.TOP),)\nrally = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostManaColor(color='W', amount=QConst(value=1)), CostManaGeneric(amount=QConst(value=2)))),\n    effect=Seq(steps=(\n        A(Verb.LOOK_AT, {'controller': ControllerRef.YOU, 'count': QConst(value=4)}),\n        OptionalEffect(inner=Seq(steps=(\n            A(Verb.REVEAL, {'controller': ControllerRef.YOU, 'count': QConst(value=1)}),\n            A(Verb.MOVE_ZONE, {\n                'cards': Selector(\n                    count=QConst(value=1), mode=SelectorMode.ONE_OF,\n                    filter=FAnd(children=(\n                        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.POWER_LE, count=QConst(value=2)),\n                        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                    )),\n                    zones=TOP),\n                'destination': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.HAND, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n            }),\n        ))),\n        A(Verb.MOVE_ZONE, {\n            'arrange': 'RANDOM',\n            'cards': Selector(count=QConst(value=1), mode=SelectorMode.REST, filter=FAnd(children=()), zones=TOP),\n            'destination': Zone(kind=ZoneKind.LIBRARY, controller=ControllerRef.YOU, position=ZonePosition.BOTTOM),\n        }),\n    )),\n)\nabilities = [rally, *compiled]\n",
